          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "మధ్యలో (madhyalō) is Sanskrit madhya, \"middle\" (CDIAL 9804), with the native ending -lō, \"in\" (DEDR 698)."
            }
          ]
